00:07:04.193 --> 00:07:06.468
When does a young
entrepreneur stop being young?

00:07:06.468 --> 00:07:07.606
You know, it's funny.

00:07:07.606 --> 00:07:10.903
I still think that I'm young,

00:07:10.903 --> 00:07:12.296
