00:07:12.296 --> 00:07:15.686
I'm 39 in a world of unlimited 29,

00:07:15.686 --> 00:07:18.426
23, 17 year old entrepreneurs.

00:07:18.426 --> 00:07:20.240
I think young is a mindset.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:22.211
I'm not sure where you're going with

00:07:22.211 --> 00:07:23.302
the kind of question.

00:07:23.302 --> 00:07:25.508
Is it appropriate to act young?

00:07:25.508 --> 00:07:27.273
I don't think I ever acted young even

00:07:27.273 --> 00:07:29.548
when I was young, but I'm young at heart.

00:07:29.548 --> 00:07:30.872
There's a lot of places where we can

00:07:30.872 --> 00:07:33.379
really go with this answer.

00:07:33.379 --> 00:07:37.605
To me I think at some level,
to be honest with you brother,

00:07:37.605 --> 00:07:39.254
I think it doesn't matter.

00:07:39.254 --> 00:07:40.438
I think it's a kind of weirdly,

00:07:40.438 --> 00:07:45.360
and almost a non-impactful question.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.730
I know that sounds harsh, but

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:49.377
what I mean by that is
there is no variable

00:07:49.377 --> 00:07:51.397
that the outside world might say,

00:07:51.397 --> 00:07:52.930
hey you're not young anymore.

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.578
Start acting your age,

00:07:54.578 --> 00:07:57.690
or they may expect you
to act a certain way

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.011
because you are young,
but at the end of the day

00:08:00.011 --> 00:08:01.753
all of it is irrelevant.

00:08:01.753 --> 00:08:03.471
Whatevers happening within yourself

00:08:03.471 --> 00:08:07.558
is the variable of your
success, your life, your upside,

00:08:07.558 --> 00:08:09.671
and so that's how I think about it.

00:08:09.671 --> 00:08:11.900
It's scary to me how young I actually.

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:13.896
I think I'm, I mean very honestly

00:08:13.896 --> 00:08:15.870
I feel dramatically younger than every,

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:17.194
I mean I actually think all these

00:08:17.194 --> 00:08:18.703
characters around me are older than me.

00:08:18.703 --> 00:08:20.978
I still watch sports and think
all those players are older

00:08:20.978 --> 00:08:22.255
than me, still.

00:08:22.255 --> 00:08:23.573
These are like 23 year olds.

00:08:23.573 --> 00:08:25.848
I'm like, like I still am in that mindset,

00:08:25.848 --> 00:08:28.310
and at some level I'm
pretty convinced that a lot

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:29.610
of the narrative that's gonna be talked

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:31.723
about me, I can see the headlines in my,

00:08:31.723 --> 00:08:33.580
I can see it right there.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:36.018
I can see the headlines when I'm 63, 67

00:08:36.018 --> 00:08:39.431
74, 83, which is like old man acts young.

00:08:39.431 --> 00:08:41.636
It's just who I am,

00:08:41.636 --> 00:08:44.377
and so the cliche age is but a number

00:08:44.377 --> 00:08:45.770
it's really true.

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:46.954
The mentality and more importantly,

00:08:46.954 --> 00:08:48.899
the execution is the variable.

